import List from "List"



alias Pourable = { end :: {} -> {}, write :: String -> {} }
#iftarget js
#- {Node} -#
#- import fs from "node:fs" -#
createSink :: String -> Pourable
export createSink = (f) => {
  x = #- fs.createWriteStream(f, {flags: 'a'}) -#
  write = (w) => #- x.write(w + "\n") -#
  end = () => #- x.end() -#
  return { write, end }
}
#- {/Node} -#
#elseif llvm
sinkOpen :: String -> {}
sinkOpen = extern "partybus__sink__open"
sinkWrite :: String -> String -> {}
sinkWrite = extern "partybus__sink__write"
sinkEnd :: String -> {}
sinkEnd = extern "partybus__sink__end"
createSink :: String -> Pourable
export createSink = (f) => {
  sinkOpen(f)
  return { write: sinkWrite(f), end: () => sinkEnd(f) }
}
#endif
export shout = (x, s) => {
  sink = createSink(x)
  sink.write(s)
  sink.end()
  return s
}
export barrage = (x, ts) => {
  sink = createSink(x)
  List.forEach(sink.write, ts)
  sink.end()
  return ts
}
